{
  "rationale": "The plant is split into perception and motion subsystems. The main specification binds perception outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, with conservative recovery and last-resort full_rotate only after repeated blockages. All obstacle events force recovery states, and forward/random_walk is prioritized in clear/search states. All transitions are deterministic and use only allowed events.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate perception (sensor) and motion (actuator) as distinct plant automata for modularity.",
    "Specification automata enforce safe, progress-maximizing exploration, with conservative obstacle recovery and minimal use of backward/full_rotate actions."
  ],
